{
  "title": "Runaway fix loop: circuit break",
  "story": "An agent keeps patching a flaky integration test. Every round produces commits, test runs, and a review, so it looks busy, but no acceptance item closes. Activity never counts as progress, so the contract breaks the loop and hands the decision back to the owner.",
  "envelope": {
    "task_ref": "DEMO-202",
    "north_star": "Nightly sync job succeeds against the staging fixture",
